        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The line graph shows the percentage of the population in three different countries who used the internet between 1999 and 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The line graph shows the percentage of the population in three different countries who used the internet between 1999 and 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Internet users as percentage of population 1999-2009</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYVsdh3adoPqlLxBlWcl4gUVgwd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Internet users as percentage of population 1999-2009 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh sự thay đổi về tỷ lệ người d&acirc;n <strong>sử dụng Internet ở ba quốc gia</strong> (Mỹ, Canada, v&agrave; Mexico) trong khoảng thời gian <strong>từ năm 1999 đến 2009</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tả số liệu \"tương đối\"</a></strong></span><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Internet users as percentage of population với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: biểu đồ đường, tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số, sử dụng Internet, ba quốc gia (Mỹ, Canada, Mexico), v&agrave; khoảng thời gian (1999 đến 2009).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMCAdCHAAo2jQNxu5Fplz84fgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UnG2dXTj8oL2X8xuX3Rlt6d3g6b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Tỷ lệ người d&ugrave;ng Internet tăng ở cả ba quốc gia trong suốt giai đoạn được khảo s&aacute;t.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jektdtz6qoRvzfxDwTGl0Vy3g8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Canada vươn l&ecirc;n trở th&agrave;nh quốc gia c&oacute; tỷ lệ cao nhất v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn, trong khi Mexico lu&ocirc;n duy tr&igrave; ở mức thấp nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> USA v&agrave; Canada</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I3ordhVfNoWEOuxsDRilaBpGg6d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của Mỹ v&agrave; Canada năm 1999</strong> <em>(Mỹ (20%) gấp đ&ocirc;i Canada (10%) v&agrave;o năm 1999.)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NJyfdS80eoSO0sx9BGmlFxMegag\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự tăng trưởng của Mỹ đến 2009 </strong><em>(Mỹ tăng trưởng đều đạt 52% năm 2004 v&agrave; 76% năm 2009)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pl4ed33acoc6y4xyyKJlo0oGgNh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự tăng trưởng của Canada đến 2009</strong> <em>(Canada tăng đ&aacute;ng kể hơn, vọt l&ecirc;n 60% năm 2004, vượt mặt Mỹ năm 2005 v&agrave; đạt mức ấn tượng 96% v&agrave;o cuối thời kỳ)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Mexico</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C3tMdTGnDoky0Pxj7N4lmwJogYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>N&ecirc;u số liệu khởi điểm rất thấp của Mexico</strong> <em>(5%)</em>&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZkhodHWLjo6eZgxl7YVlXxT6gWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng tăng trưởng ổn định nhưng khi&ecirc;m tốn của Mexico qua c&aacute;c năm</strong>&nbsp;<em>(d&ugrave; tăng đều nhưng chậm hơn nhiều so với c&aacute;c h&agrave;ng x&oacute;m ph&iacute;a Bắc, đạt 20% năm 2004 cuối c&ugrave;ng đạt 40% năm 2009)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fwlpd0CpRocGJixfacylqr6Rgce\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>So s&aacute;nh với USA</strong><em> (&iacute;t hơn ph&acirc;n nửa số liệu cuối c&ugrave;ng của USA)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MmfsdYo5DonotExPR3sl0UZSgEh\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, cụm từ \"<strong>tỷ lệ người d&ugrave;ng Internet</strong>\"&nbsp;sẽ xuất hiện thường xuy&ecirc;n, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMCwd91L7oZtYPxBjmMljLlfgGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">the proportion of people who accessed the Internet</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zc1qdET2IoVVjqx5oQlleXPmgbb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Internet penetration rate</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zc1qdET2IoVVjqx5oQlleXPmgbb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Internet usage</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKRQdKUJVot2X7xqYi6lP63SgRd\">V&iacute; dụ:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ln1SdJ9gno0g09xYUsWl1RVMgiL\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VXXcdx2ZfowVJdxXEuflbp4vg9f\">Regarding Mexico, this country started with the lowest <strong>internet penetration rate</strong> at merely 5% in 1999</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2531,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The line graph illustrates the proportion of people who accessed the internet in the USA, Canada, and Mexico over an 11-year period from 1999 to 2009.</p>",
            "question_id": 24487,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2532,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, all three countries experienced an upward trend in internet usage throughout the given period. While Canada achieved the highest percentage by 2009, Mexico consistently remained the lowest among the three nations.</p>",
            "question_id": 24487,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2533,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the two North American developed countries, in 1999, the USA had approximately 20% of its population using the internet, which was double Canada's figure at around 10%. The USA showed steady growth over the subsequent years, reaching approximately 52% by 2004 before continuing to rise more gradually to 76% in 2009. Canada, however, demonstrated a more dramatic increase, surging from its initial 10% to 60% by 2004, overtaking the USA around 2005, and ultimately reaching an impressive 96% by the end of the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 24487,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2534,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding Mexico, this country started with the lowest internet penetration rate at merely 5% in 1999. Although it maintained consistent growth throughout the decade, the pace was considerably slower than its northern neighbors, rising to only 20% by 2004 and eventually reaching 40% in 2009, which was less than half of the USA's final figure.</p>",
            "question_id": 24487,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
